'''Miku Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] and can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event#Hatsune Miku|Hatsune Miku]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 538
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Miku Cat
|name2 = Miku Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Miku Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Can be used as an anti-Floating meatshield in early game or 4-crown. Unfortunately for them, this is their only use as outside this restriction, they can be easily replaced by [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]]. To make matters worse, [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]] completely blows them out of the water even in the Restriction niche once obtained. Overall, there's not much to see here.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

